          "request": {
            "name": "Launches a Deployment Analysis Process",
            "description": {
              "content": "Launches a Deployment Analysis Process, detecting impacts that promoting this asset to a new stage might have on its consumers, and what might be the impacts on itself, as it relates to its producers\n\nAPI Client needs the **Release management > Deploy assets** permission.",
